WEBVTT

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.101
All the technology
behind virtual worlds is different.

00:11:30.125 --> 00:11:31.737
So, my plea to you is this.

00:11:31.761 --> 00:11:33.904
Let's engage, let's all engage,

00:11:33.928 --> 00:11:37.754
let's actually try to make this something
that we shape in a positive way,

00:11:37.778 --> 00:11:40.793
rather than once again have be done to us.

00:11:40.817 --> 00:11:41.968
Thank you.

00:11:41.992 --> 00:11:47.150
(Applause)